45 to binary:
  45 / 2 = 22 remainder 1
  22 / 2 = 11 remainder 0
  11 / 2 = 5 remainder 1
  5 / 2 = 2 remainder 1
  2 / 2 = 1 remainder 0
  1 / 2 = 0 remainder 1
45 = 101101 in binary

200 to binary:
  200 / 2 = 100 remainder 0
  100 / 2 = 50 remainder 0
  50 / 2 = 25 remainder 0
  25 / 2 = 12 remainder 1
  12 / 2 = 6 remainder 0
  6 / 2 = 3 remainder 0
  3 / 2 = 1 remainder 1
  1 / 2 = 0 remainder 1
200 = 11001000 in binary

10110 to decimal:
  read 1, value is now 1
  read 0, value is now 2
  read 1, value is now 5
  read 1, value is now 11
  read 0, value is now 22
10110 = 22 in decimal
